config COMPONENT_FUEL_GAUGE
    bool "FUEL_GAUGE Component"
    default y
    select COMPONENT_DEVICE
    help
      Fuel gauge core plus the BQ27Z746/BQ27Z561/BQ40Z50/MAX17043 drivers.

      The drivers reach the bus through the canonical Device helpers
      (`xy_i2c_device_read_reg16_repeated_start()` and friends), so this
      component cannot be built without COMPONENT_DEVICE.

      NOTE: this fragment is not read by the build. `cmake/kconfig_parser.py`
      parses the root `Kconfig` only (it refuses `source`), so the
      authoritative definition lives in `Kconfig` under "Additional
      Components" and this file mirrors it. Change both, and let
      `check_kconfig_fragment_agreement.py` keep them consistent.
